{
	"name": "Notion content calendar to sprkly, with a clash check",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "23451fd9-aff3-41b9-8d46-1d6f6d7388a1",
			"name": "Overview",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-1000,
				-80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Notion content calendar to sprkly, with a clash check\n\n### How it works\n- When a page in your Notion database changes to Status **Ready**, it reads the page.\n- It asks sprkly for the posts already scheduled, and counts the ones on the same accounts within 2 hours of the page's time.\n- None found: the page becomes a scheduled post. External ID `notion-<page id>` means a re-run never posts twice. The page gets back its Status, sprkly Post ID, time and any error.\n- Found some: nothing is booked. The page gets Status **Clash** and a short reason.\n- When a post goes out, the page gets **Published** and the link. When it fails, **Failed** and the reason.\n\n### Setup\n- Needs the n8n-nodes-sprkly community node (Settings, Community Nodes). More: https://github.com/ahlanlhw/n8n-nodes-sprkly\n- Add your sprkly API key to the 5 sprkly nodes. API docs: https://sprkly.app/docs/api\n- Add your Notion login to the 4 Notion nodes. Share the database with it, and pick it in **When a page changes**.\n- Properties: Caption (text), Publish Time (date with a time), Accounts (text or multi-select), Media URL (URL), Status (status), Link (URL), sprkly Post ID, Scheduled For and Error (text).\n- Status options: Ready, Scheduled, Clash, Error, Published, Failed.\n- Accounts looks like `instagram:myhandle, telegram:My channel`.\n\n### Customize\n- Change the 2 hours in **Count clashes**.",
				"height": 840,
				"width": 520,
				"color": 1
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "3d2f8013-7ca4-43a4-bf32-dc976e94dbe2",
			"name": "Note: check then book",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-440,
				80
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Check the day, then book\nThe two sprkly reads run once per run, not once per page. A page whose time clashes gets Status Clash. Pick a new time and set Status to Ready again.",
				"height": 560,
				"width": 2000,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "fefd6840-5e7e-441f-98bf-63996bc74d16",
			"name": "Note: track posts",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-440,
				740
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Track what happened\nWhen a post goes out or fails, the page is found by its id. Only posts with an External ID that starts with notion- reach this database.",
				"height": 440,
				"width": 760,
				"color": 7
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "e665f159-d046-4b38-94d3-8d4e9359435e",
			"name": "When a page changes",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.notionTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				-400,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"pollTimes": {
					"item": [
						{
							"mode": "everyX",
							"value": 5,
							"unit": "minutes"
						}
					]
				},
				"event": "pagedUpdatedInDatabase",
				"dataSourceId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "",
					"mode": "list"
				},
				"simple": true
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "a1867ebd-d2d6-4fd1-9bb1-fdfb575f6ed0",
			"name": "Only Ready pages",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
			"typeVersion": 2.2,
			"position": [
				-160,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"conditions": {
					"options": {
						"caseSensitive": true,
						"leftValue": "",
						"typeValidation": "strict",
						"version": 2
					},
					"conditions": [
						{
							"id": "is-ready",
							"leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
							"rightValue": "Ready",
							"operator": {
								"type": "string",
								"operation": "equals"
							}
						}
					],
					"combinator": "and"
				},
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "b9321601-28d2-4b70-9197-1c6f11c2af17",
			"name": "Get sprkly accounts",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				80,
				480
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "account",
				"operation": "getAll",
				"returnAll": true
			},
			"executeOnce": true,
			"alwaysOutputData": true
		},
		{
			"id": "dd003869-f929-4255-be06-26ae22fd478d",
			"name": "Get scheduled posts",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				320,
				480
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "post",
				"operation": "getAll",
				"returnAll": true,
				"filters": {
					"status": "scheduled"
				},
				"simplify": true
			},
			"executeOnce": true,
			"alwaysOutputData": true
		},
		{
			"id": "57345051-d79c-4311-a59a-1b3b50914bb7",
			"name": "Wait for both",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
			"typeVersion": 3.2,
			"position": [
				560,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"mode": "chooseBranch",
				"useDataOfInput": 1
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "a2d66f5b-3ea1-43f9-a7f3-a49810e585c6",
			"name": "Count clashes",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
			"typeVersion": 3.4,
			"position": [
				800,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"assignments": {
					"assignments": [
						{
							"id": "clashes",
							"name": "clashes",
							"value": "={{ $('Get scheduled posts').all().filter(p => p.json.scheduledTime && !String(p.json.externalId || '').startsWith('notion-' + $json.id) && Math.abs(DateTime.fromISO(p.json.scheduledTime).toMillis() - DateTime.fromISO(($json['Publish Time'] || {}).start || '').toMillis()) <= 2 * 60 * 60 * 1000 && $('Get sprkly accounts').all().some(a => (p.json.profileIds || []).includes(a.json.id) && [].concat($json.Accounts || []).join(',').toLowerCase().replace(/[@\\s]/g, '').split(',').includes((a.json.platform + ':' + a.json.handle).toLowerCase().replace(/[@\\s]/g, '')))).length }}",
							"type": "number"
						}
					]
				},
				"includeOtherFields": true,
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "b74b7890-408f-4925-9e45-5f0a2ddd8a9b",
			"name": "Free to book?",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
			"typeVersion": 2.2,
			"position": [
				1040,
				320
			],
			"parameters": {
				"conditions": {
					"options": {
						"caseSensitive": true,
						"leftValue": "",
						"typeValidation": "loose",
						"version": 2
					},
					"conditions": [
						{
							"id": "no-clash",
							"leftValue": "={{ $json.clashes }}",
							"rightValue": 0,
							"operator": {
								"type": "number",
								"operation": "equals"
							}
						}
					],
					"combinator": "and"
				},
				"looseTypeValidation": true,
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "b1c208d7-8d6c-45c1-81c4-a52edc108fa4",
			"name": "Book in sprkly",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-sprkly.sprkly",
			"typeVersion": 1.1,
			"position": [
				1280,
				200
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "post",
				"operation": "create",
				"accountMode": "name",
				"accountNames": "={{ [].concat($json.Accounts || []).join(', ') }}",
				"caption": "={{ $json.Caption }}",
				"scheduledTime": "={{ ($json['Publish Time'] || {}).start || '' }}",
				"output": "resultRow",
				"additionalFields": {
					"externalId": "={{ 'notion-' + $json.id }}",
					"mediaUrls": "={{ $json['Media URL'] || '' }}",
					"requireExternalId": true
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "b7d17ab3-6581-4f76-b905-345f4eaef6a2",
			"name": "Write result to page",
